# WebSocket 语音中继功能测试

## 1. 发起语音呼叫
POST http://localhost:5002/api/v1/voice/call/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "VIGIDOOR_TEST_RPI"
}

###

## 2. 查询会话状态
GET http://localhost:5002/api/v1/voice/call/status/VIGIDOOR_TEST_RPI

###

## 3. 列出所有会话
GET http://localhost:5002/api/v1/voice/sessions

###

## 4. 终止语音呼叫
POST http://localhost:5002/api/v1/voice/call/terminate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "VIGIDOOR_TEST_RPI"
}

###

## 5. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:5002/health

###
